WEBVTT

00:02.410 --> 00:07.920
<u>I  LOVE  ANIME</u>

00:02.410 --> 00:07.920
STUDIO  RIVA - Nyo

00:02.410 --> 00:07.920
<b>#ILA @ Rizon</b>

00:06.220 --> 00:12.920
<b>Sekai de ichiban kagayakeru made</b>

00:13.500 --> 00:19.260
<b>Ichinichi mainichi wo tanoshiku ikite</b>

00:19.500 --> 00:24.770
<b>Totsuzen umarekuru setsuna no fuan</b>

00:25.280 --> 00:31.370
<b>2000-nen mondai yori
jibun no yume</b>

00:31.480 --> 00:37.350
<b>Sekai de ichiban kagayakitai</b>

00:37.450 --> 00:40.420
<b>Omoi wa number 1 star</b>

00:40.520 --> 00:43.490
<b>Kono sora no naka de</b>

00:47.690 --> 00:50.020
<b>Wake up gema.
Dejiko, it's time to get up gema!</b>

00:50.130 --> 00:54.530
<b>No! I cannot get up mi.</b>

00:54.630 --> 00:56.100
<b>What are you talking about gema?</b>

00:56.200 --> 00:58.790
<b>The day doesn't begin
until you get out of bed gema.</b>

00:58.900 --> 01:01.030
<b>C'mon, Dejiko. Wake up gema.</b>

01:02.100 --> 01:03.900
<b>Oh, you finally showed
your face gema.</b>

01:04.010 --> 01:07.870
<b>I am a shijimi clam.
I love fresh, clean water.</b>

01:07.980 --> 01:11.170
<b>I'm happy with a little seawater, too.</b>

01:11.280 --> 01:13.710
<b>I am a double-shelled shijimi clam.</b>

01:13.820 --> 01:16.940
<b>Sometimes you'll find me
in miso-soup, mi.</b>

01:17.050 --> 01:19.750
<b>She's been possessed by
the spirit of a shijimi clam gema.</b>

01:19.860 --> 01:22.590
<b>Last night she threw out the shijimi
and only drank the soup.</b>

01:22.690 --> 01:24.520
<b>She's been cursed for wasting food.</b>

01:24.630 --> 01:29.330
<b>It's fun to dig meat out of
each shijimi clam shell nyu.</b>

01:29.430 --> 01:32.260
<b>What a waste to throw away
all that meat.</b>

01:32.370 --> 01:34.770
<b>I'm going to possess this girl
for the rest of her life mi!</b>

01:34.870 --> 01:37.300
<b>What should we do gema?
Now she'll never become a huge idol.</b>

01:37.410 --> 01:39.840
<b>Puchiko always eats her clams nyu.</b>

01:40.140 --> 01:42.980
<b>We're going to need someone
to lift her curse gema.</b>

01:43.080 --> 01:45.210
<b>I heard about what happened!</b>

01:45.310 --> 01:48.840
<b>What are you doing here?
No one invited you gema!</b>

01:48.950 --> 01:50.080
<b>She must be bored nyu.</b>

01:50.190 --> 01:52.590
<b>Many things happen in the world.</b>

01:53.190 --> 01:57.520
<b>It's just like stupid Dejiko
to be possessed by a clam.</b>

01:57.630 --> 01:59.460
<b>Stop that.</b>

01:59.560 --> 02:01.260
<b>I'm a clam mi.</b>

02:01.360 --> 02:04.590
<b>I have a hard double-shell
surrounding me mi.</b>

02:04.830 --> 02:06.320
<b>Rabi-en flying kick!</b>

02:08.300 --> 02:10.100
<b>I eat one at a time nyu.</b>

02:10.210 --> 02:14.970
<b>Look, you're not in a hard shell.
You're in a soft blanket.</b>

02:15.080 --> 02:16.370
<b>Help, why are you doing this to me?</b>

02:16.480 --> 02:18.110
<b>I heard you had a problem.</b>

02:18.210 --> 02:20.340
<b>I think you should get
someone to lift the curse.</b>

02:20.450 --> 02:23.650
<b>Another uninvited guest gema.</b>

02:23.750 --> 02:25.120
<b>He must be bored, too nyu.</b>

02:25.220 --> 02:29.210
<b>Don't worry, Puchiko-chan.
I found someone who removes curses.</b>

02:29.320 --> 02:32.620
<b>Oh, I studied a little bit about
removing curses in school.</b>

02:33.630 --> 02:34.120
<b>Sign : Clam</b>

02:35.600 --> 02:37.160
<b>Let's begin!</b>

02:50.010 --> 02:51.740
<b>Shijimi soup tastes great!</b>

03:01.090 --> 03:02.220
<b>Don't make me cry.</b>

03:04.690 --> 03:06.290
<b>Dejiko.</b>

03:07.860 --> 03:10.660
<b>I slept well nyo!
I feel great nyo!</b>

03:11.130 --> 03:13.690
<b>What's everyone doing here nyo?</b>

03:13.800 --> 03:16.700
<b>I'm so glad gema.
She's back to normal gema.</b>

03:16.810 --> 03:18.800
<b>You're pretty amazing.</b>

03:19.410 --> 03:23.970
<b>My quick thinking was impressive, too,
wasn't it, Puchiko-chan?</b>

03:24.080 --> 03:26.210
<b>Bu-bu-bu.</b>

03:26.310 --> 03:28.180
<b>There's something wrong
with Puchiko nyo!</b>

03:28.280 --> 03:31.580
<b>Puchiko is possessed
by a snail gema.</b>

03:31.690 --> 03:35.180
<b>Don't worry. We have someone
who can remove the curse!</b>

03:35.290 --> 03:39.280
<b>I'm sorry. I only know
how to remove the curse of the clam.</b>

03:39.390 --> 03:40.860
<b>What!?</b>
